WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.451
Whiteboards get rubbed out, and paper job sheets go out of date.

2
00:00:05.251 --> 00:00:08.680
One late Friday change, and Saturday’s crew turns up short.

3
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.833
With reloops, every move, van, and crew member stays in full view.

4
00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:21.576
Every job follows eight clear steps, from first enquiry right through to getting paid.

5
00:00:22.376 --> 00:00:25.806
And the green Next button always shows what the move is waiting for.

6
00:00:28.508 --> 00:00:34.096
Each morning, meters count vans out and drivers or porters named against what the day needs.

7
00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:43.969
Drag your seven and a half tonne lorry and your driver Liam onto the job, with two porters — or press Auto Fill, even on two-day moves.

8
00:00:45.769 --> 00:00:49.522
When the day is set, check who gets the run sheet before anything goes out.

9
00:00:50.322 --> 00:00:54.256
Press Share with crew, and the row ticks Booked and Sheet sent.

10
00:00:57.019 --> 00:01:03.459
Out on the road, crews sign in to the Field App with a six-digit text code, with no passwords to forget.

11
00:01:04.259 --> 00:01:10.882
They see their start time, crewmates, both addresses, parking and stairs notes, and every room to load.

12
00:01:12.682 --> 00:01:17.721
Every job in full view, from office to van. Book a fifteen-minute call on our website.
